@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #466482
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #9AA8B8
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #334155
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam sequenceParticipantPadding 18
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
hide footbox
autonumber
!include course-notation.iuml
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor transparent
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor transparent
title B 改进业务序列：部门协作

actor "需求方" as D
participant "<$worker>\n目标部门部长" as M
participant "<$worker>\n承接干事" as W
participant "<$entity>\n部门任务档案" as S
D -> S : 登记摄影预约、设计或部门需求
alt 摄影任务公开领取
W -> S : 领取未来且未分配任务
else 部门安排
M -> S : 登记承接人或采用默认／轮转安排
end
W -> S : 提交完整交付物
M -> S : 检查交付物
alt 正常验收通过
M -> S : 登记验收结论
activate S
S -> S : 一并保留归档与一次工时
S --> W : 完成回执
deactivate S
else 退回修改
M -> S : 登记退回原因
S --> W : 修改要求
else 异常强制关闭
M -> S : 登记强制关闭原因
S -> S : 保留关闭事实，不生成自动工时
end

@enduml
